text:
Proportional scaling in Deployments in not fully re-entrant

The fix is to avoid scaling replica sets with replica annotations synced to the actual size of the deployment. While doing that, we need to handle gracefully the case where all replica sets have their annotations synced but the sum of their spec.replicas does not match spec.replicas of the deployment.

@kubernetes/sig-apps-bugs

