{"describe the bug": "In some build environments (like Kubernetes), the order of the keys in `process.env` is non-deterministic.  This can result in build outputs from the same source code and environment that have different hashes due to arbitrary variations in the order of the included `REACT_APP_*` variables.", "reproducible demo": "See the repo at: https://github.com/apogee-stealth/cra-env-test

