model_text:
[Bug]: @storybook/addon-themes@7 doesn't update data-attr with inline: false

Describe the bug:
I have the following setup for `addon-themes`
```ts
//preview.ts
  decorators: [
    withThemeByDataAttribute({
      themes: {
        light: "light",
        dark: "dark",
        system: "system",
      },
      defaultTheme: "light",
      parentSelector: "html",
      attributeName: "data-theme",
    }),
  ],
```

And it doesn't work well with the `inline: false` param. With other stories it works well.
```ts
const meta: Meta<typeof CBottomSheet> = {
  title: "Components/Bottom Sheet",
  component: CBottomSheet,
  parameters: {
    docs: {
      story: {
        inline: false,
      },
    },
  },
};
```

